WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
I usually cook by myself after the live broadcast

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:04,840
It's a bit crude, don't mind it.

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,770
It's nice to live alone. It's quiet.

4
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:10,850
Brother, today you can transfer a million as a reward to me.

5
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,170
My heartbeat hasn't calmed down yet.

6
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,970
What do you usually like?

7
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,570
I'll put some water in for you to take a bath

8
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:19,890
In this case, I'll take my leave first.

9
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,730
Brother, don't go

10
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:25,460
Sorry, brother, I'm used to the same routine as before

11
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,820
I won't make trouble anymore

12
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,060
Let's sit down and have a nice chat, okay?

13
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,470
It's normal to chat like this

14
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:37,990
Brother, you can buy tens of millions of luxury cars in a while

15
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:39,590
After a while, I went to the roadside to sell fruit.

16
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:41,070
What is your business?

17
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,390
I'm a folk treasure hunter

18
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,670
Specializes in finding treasures of genius in places where people are cold

19
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:46,990
For example, the finest jadeite, natural gemstones, and thousand-year-old medicinal materials

20
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,990
There really is an industry of treasure hunters in the world

21
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:51,390
Isn't it true that all of them are highly skilled in martial arts? You are right.

22
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:53,070
Treasure hunters have some hidden skills

23
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,030
Otherwise try again
